TI  - A LoRa relay based system for detonating explosives in underground mines
PY  - 2020
T2  - Proceedings of the IEEE International Conference on Industrial Technology
VL  - 2020-February
C7  - 9067213
SP  - 259
EP  - 264
DO  - 10.1109/ICIT45562.2020.9067213
