AB  - Efforts towards a cheap yet efficient health care infrastructure for remote rural areas requires longrange remote sensing communication over large areas. However, establishing efficient healthcare infrastructure in remote areas in developing countries like India, continues to be hampered by the lack of cost-effective and scalable IoT solutions. In this paper, a technique of multihop LoRa Network is built using relay for quality health data transmission for low-cost low power solution. © 2023 IEEE.
